   6:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * \brief WAV file header parser — implementation
   7:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** *
   8:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * Reads the 44-byte RIFF/WAV header from a FatFs FIL handle, converts all
   9:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * multi-byte fields from little-endian wire format to host byte order, and
  10:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * validates format constraints required by the VDAC8 hardware.
  11:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** *
  12:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * \copyright Copyright 2025
  13:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * Department of electrical engineering and information technology,
  14:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * Hochschule Darmstadt - University of applied sciences (h_da).
  15:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** *
  16:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * \warning This software is a PROTOTYPE version and is not designed or
  17:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * intended for use in production, especially not for safety-critical
  18:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * applications!
  19:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** */
